Error [E0711]: the `Authority` handle `abilities` can't escape its `#Caps` block
  --> tests/ui/grant_handle_escapes.jet:6:18
    |
  6 |         alias :: abilities
    |                  ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Caps(…)` revokes the `Authority` at the end of its block (RAII); returning, storing, or sharing `abilities` would let revoked rights outlive the scope
 Fix: use `abilities` only inside the `#Caps` block, or perform the work there
